# ROSE.md A.1 — the owner's raster logo, the generated mockup and the style
# sheet. Reference material for redrawing the mark, never served: the mockup
# carries invented numbers and must not sit on our domain under a guessable
# name. collectstatic drops them too, apps/core/management/commands.
static/img/brand/source
